<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
  <title>Thomas Gaudard — Portfolio</title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:wght@400;700;900&family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet"/>
  <style>
    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

    :root {
      --noir: #0D0D0D;
      --nuit: #1A1A2E;
      --or: #C8922A;
      --or-clair: #E8B84B;
      --ivoire: #F2EBD9;
      --gris: #4A4A6A;
      --gris-clair: #9090AA;
    }

    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }

    body {
      background: var(--noir);
      color: var(--ivoire);
      font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
      overflow-x: hidden;
    }

    /* ── NAV ── */
    nav {
      position: fixed;
      top: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
      z-index: 100;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 18px 48px;
      background: rgba(13, 13, 13, 0.85);
      backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(200, 146, 42, 0.15);
    }

    .nav-logo {
      font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
      font-size: 1.3rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--or);
      letter-spacing: 0.03em;
    }

    .nav-links {
      display: flex;
      gap: 36px;
      list-style: none;
    }

    .nav-links a {
      color: var(--gris-clair);
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      font-weight: 500;
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      transition: color 0.25s;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .nav-links a:hover,
    .nav-links a.active { color: var(--or); }

    /* ── SECTIONS ── */
    section {
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: none;
      flex-direction: column;
      padding-top: 80px;
    }

    section.active { display: flex; }

    /* ══════════════════════════════
       PAGE ACCUEIL
    ══════════════════════════════ */
    #accueil {
      position: relative;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      overflow: hidden;
      background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 60% 40%, #1a1a2e 0%, #0D0D0D 65%);
    }

    .sax-canvas {
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    .hero-content {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 2;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 0 24px;
    }

    .hero-eyebrow {
      display: inline-block;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.28em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--or);
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(200,146,42,0.4);
      padding: 6px 16px;
      border-radius: 2px;
    }

    .hero-name {
      font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
      font-size: clamp(3.5rem, 9vw, 8rem);
      font-weight: 900;
      line-height: 0.95;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      color: var(--ivoire);
    }

    .hero-name span {
      color: var(--or);
      display: block;
    }

    .hero-sub {
      margin-top: 28px;
      font-size: 1rem;
      color: var(--gris-clair);
      font-weight: 300;
      letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    }

    .hero-cta {
      margin-top: 48px;
      display: inline-block;
      background: var(--or);
      color: var(--noir);
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      padding: 14px 36px;
      border-radius: 2px;
      cursor: pointer;
      border: none;
      transition: background 0.25s, transform 0.2s;
    }

    .hero-cta:hover {
      background: var(--or-clair);
      transform: translateY(-2px);
    }

    .scroll-indicator {
      position: absolute;
      bottom: 36px;
      left: 50%;
      transform: translateX(-50%);
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      color: var(--gris-clair);
      font-size: 0.7rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.15em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      animation: bounce 2s infinite;
    }

    .scroll-indicator::after {
      content: '';
      width: 1px;
      height: 40px;
      background: linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--or), transparent);
    }

    @keyframes bounce {
      0%, 100% { transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(0); }
      50% { transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(6px); }
    }

    /* ══════════════════════════════
       PAGE PARCOURS
    ══════════════════════════════ */
    #parcours {
      background: linear-gradient(160deg, #0f0f1f 0%, #0D0D0D 100%);
      padding: 120px 48px 80px;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .section-header {
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 72px;
    }

    .section-label {
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.25em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--or);
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .section-title {
      font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
      font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 5vw, 4rem);
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--ivoire);
      line-height: 1.1;
    }

    .timeline {
      max-width: 700px;
      width: 100%;
      position: relative;
    }

    .timeline::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      left: 28px;
      top: 0; bottom: 0;
      width: 1px;
      background: linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--or), rgba(200,146,42,0.1));
    }

    .timeline-item {
      display: flex;
      gap: 32px;
      margin-bottom: 56px;
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateX(-24px);
      transition: opacity 0.6s, transform 0.6s;
    }

    .timeline-item.visible {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: none;
    }

    .timeline-dot {
      flex-shrink: 0;
      width: 56px;
      height: 56px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--nuit);
      border: 2px solid var(--or);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-size: 1.4rem;
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
    }

    .timeline-body {
      padding-top: 8px;
    }

    .timeline-year {
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.18em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--or);
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }

    .timeline-title {
      font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
      font-size: 1.3rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--ivoire);
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .timeline-place {
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      color: var(--gris-clair);
      font-style: italic;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .timeline-desc {
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      line-height: 1.7;
      color: #aaaacc;
    }

    .badge {
      display: inline-block;
      background: rgba(200,146,42,0.12);
      border: 1px solid rgba(200,146,42,0.3);
      color: var(--or);
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      padding: 4px 10px;
      border-radius: 2px;
      margin-top: 10px;
    }

    /* ══════════════════════════════
       PAGE LOISIRS
    ══════════════════════════════ */
    #loisirs {
      background: var(--noir);
      padding: 120px 48px 80px;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .hobbies-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
      gap: 24px;
      max-width: 960px;
      width: 100%;
    }

    .hobby-card {
      background: var(--nuit);
      border: 1px solid rgba(200,146,42,0.12);
      border-radius: 4px;
      padding: 36px 30px;
      transition: border-color 0.3s, transform 0.3s;
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateY(20px);
      transition: opacity 0.5s, transform 0.5s, border-color 0.3s;
    }

    .hobby-card.visible {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: none;
    }

    .hobby-card:hover {
      border-color: rgba(200,146,42,0.5);
      transform: translateY(-4px);
    }

    .hobby-icon {
      font-size: 2.8rem;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .hobby-title {
      font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
      font-size: 1.35rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--ivoire);
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .hobby-desc {
      font-size: 0.88rem;
      line-height: 1.75;
      color: #9090AA;
    }

    .hobby-tag {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-top: 16px;
      background: rgba(200,146,42,0.1);
      color: var(--or);
      font-size: 0.7rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      padding: 3px 10px;
      border-radius: 2px;
    }

    /* ══════════════════════════════
       PAGE CONTACT
    ══════════════════════════════ */
    #contact {
      background: linear-gradient(160deg, #0f0f1f 0%, #0D0D0D 100%);
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 80px 24px;
    }

    .contact-inner {
      max-width: 560px;
    }

    .contact-inner .section-title {
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .contact-intro {
      font-size: 1rem;
      color: var(--gris-clair);
      line-height: 1.7;
      margin-bottom: 48px;
    }

    .contact-form {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 16px;
      text-align: left;
    }

    .form-row { display: flex; gap: 16px; }

    .form-group {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 6px;
      flex: 1;
    }

    .form-group label {
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.15em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--or);
    }

    .form-group input,
    .form-group textarea {
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
      border: 1px solid rgba(200,146,42,0.2);
      color: var(--ivoire);
      font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      padding: 12px 14px;
      border-radius: 2px;
      outline: none;
      transition: border-color 0.25s;
    }

    .form-group input:focus,
    .form-group textarea:focus {
      border-color: var(--or);
    }

    .form-group textarea { resize: vertical; min-height: 120px; }

    .form-submit {
      background: var(--or);
      color: var(--noir);
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      padding: 14px;
      border: none;
      border-radius: 2px;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: background 0.25s, transform 0.2s;
    }

    .form-submit:hover {
      background: var(--or-clair);
      transform: translateY(-2px);
    }

    .contact-decoration {
      position: absolute;
      font-size: 18rem;
      opacity: 0.015;
      font-family: serif;
      pointer-events: none;
      user-select: none;
      bottom: -40px;
      right: -20px;
    }

    /* ══════════════════════════════
       PAGE COMPÉTENCES
    ══════════════════════════════ */
    #competences {
      background: var(--noir);
      padding: 120px 48px 80px;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .skills-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
      gap: 24px;
      max-width: 1000px;
      width: 100%;
    }

    .skill-card {
      background: var(--nuit);
      border: 1px solid rgba(200,146,42,0.12);
      border-radius: 4px;
      padding: 32px 28px;
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateY(20px);
      transition: opacity 0.5s, transform 0.5s, border-color 0.3s;
    }

    .skill-card.visible {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: none;
    }

    .skill-card:hover {
      border-color: rgba(200,146,42,0.5);
    }

    .skill-icon {
      font-size: 2.4rem;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }

    .skill-title {
      font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--ivoire);
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }

    .skill-source {
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--or);
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }

    .skill-desc {
      font-size: 0.88rem;
      line-height: 1.75;
      color: #9090AA;
    }

    /* ── FOOTER ── */
      background: var(--noir);
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(200,146,42,0.1);
      text-align: center;
      padding: 20px;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      color: var(--gris);
      display: none;
    }

    footer.active { display: block; }

    /* ── RESPONSIVE ── */
    @media (max-width: 640px) {
      nav { padding: 14px 20px; }
      .nav-links { gap: 16px; }
      .nav-links a { font-size: 0.72rem; }
      #parcours, #loisirs, #competences { padding: 120px 20px 60px; }
      .form-row { flex-direction: column; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- NAV -->
<nav>
  <div></div>
  <ul class="nav-links">
    <li><a onclick="showPage('accueil')" class="active" id="nav-accueil">Accueil</a></li>
    <li><a onclick="showPage('parcours')" id="nav-parcours">Parcours</a></li>
    <li><a onclick="showPage('loisirs')" id="nav-loisirs">Loisirs</a></li>
    <li><a onclick="showPage('competences')" id="nav-competences">Compétences</a></li>

  </ul>
</nav>

<!-- ══ PAGE ACCUEIL ══ -->
<section id="accueil" class="active">
  <canvas class="sax-canvas" id="saxCanvas"></canvas>
  <div class="hero-content">
    <div class="hero-eyebrow">✦ Portfolio 2026</div>
    <h1 class="hero-name">
      Thomas<span>Gaudard</span>
    </h1>
    <p class="hero-sub">Étudiant en BUT Réseaux & Télécommunications · Marseille</p>
    <button class="hero-cta" onclick="showPage('parcours')">Découvrir mon parcours</button>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ══ PAGE PARCOURS ══ -->
<section id="parcours">
  <div class="section-header">
    <p class="section-label">Mon histoire</p>
    <h2 class="section-title">Parcours &amp; Formation</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="timeline">
    <div class="timeline-item">
      <div class="timeline-dot">🏫</div>
      <div class="timeline-body">
        <div class="timeline-year">2023 – 2025</div>
        <div class="timeline-title">Bac STI2D</div>
        <div class="timeline-place">Lycée des Iscles, Manosque</div>
        <div class="timeline-desc">
          J'ai fait mon bac STI2D au lycée des Iscles, à Manosque. C'est là que j'ai 
          commencé à m'intéresser aux systèmes numériques et à l'énergie, et ça m'a 
          donné envie d'aller plus loin dans le domaine du numérique.
        </div>
        <span class="badge">Lycée des Iscles</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="timeline-item">
      <div class="timeline-dot">🎓</div>
